.camera-page {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100vh;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #111111;
}

.camera-view {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  /* width/height are bound inline from computeGuideLayout(): Alipay's <camera> is a
     NATIVE component whose surface must be sized from an explicit box, so we must not
     rely on `bottom` stretch + `height: auto` (that is a WeChat-DOM assumption). */
  width: 100%;
}

/* PREVIEW FILL IS NOT EXPRESSIBLE IN ACSS -- do not add a rule here.

   Alipay's runtime mounts the camera preview as an inner <video> inside the native
   <camera> host, carrying NO class attribute, and sets only an inline `width: 100%`.
   With no height it collapses to the STREAM's intrinsic aspect ratio (measured
   1280x720 -> 219.38px tall) while the host box is 654px, so ~2/3 of the camera area
   stays black and the framing guide no longer lines up with the picture.

   Two rules have been tried. Both are dead, and the second one broke the build:

     1. `.camera-view video` -- the ACSS compiler rewrites the bare element selector
        (`video` -> `.a-video`), so the rule can never match the classless preview.
     2. `.camera-view > :not([class])` -- DOES NOT COMPILE. Measured 2026-09-21 with
        `verify:alipay-builder`:
          error[CE1000.02]: should only be one class selector, got .camera-view with class
        The ACSS compiler accepts ONLY a single simple selector (one class or one
        element). Descendant and child combinators, compound selectors, pseudo-classes,
        :not() and * are all rejected. "Scope it under the component class" is not an
        escape hatch, because scoping IS a combinator.

   A compiling rule would not have been enough either -- the builder also reports
   `warning[CW1000.03]: object-fit 不支持`.

   So the fill cannot be fixed from the mini-program code: the preview lives inside a
   native component, which page JS cannot reach via my.createSelectorQuery() either.
   Either treat preview/host = 0.3354 as a platform constraint and align the guide to
   the real picture box, or confirm on a physical device first -- that measurement came
   from the simulator, which is known to diverge from device rendering. */

.camera-copy {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 5;
  top: 34rpx;
  right: 24rpx;
  left: 24rpx;
  color: #ffffff;
  text-align: center;
  text-shadow: 0 2rpx 8rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
}

.camera-init-hint {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 8;
  top: 148rpx;
  right: 36rpx;
  left: 36rpx;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  font-size: 24rpx;
  line-height: 36rpx;
  text-align: center;
  text-shadow: 0 2rpx 7rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
}

.camera-title {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 42rpx;
}

.camera-subtitle {
  margin-top: 4rpx;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  line-height: 38rpx;
}

.portrait-guide {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 4;
  opacity: 0.98;
}

.eye-label {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 5;
  right: 0;
  left: 0;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
  font-size: 21rpx;
  text-align: center;
  text-shadow: 0 2rpx 7rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
}

.camera-controls {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 10;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  height: 190rpx;
  padding: 18rpx 54rpx 18rpx 54rpx;
  background: rgba(9, 10, 12, 0.96);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.control-side {
  flex: 1;
  height: 118rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #ffffff;
}

.control-icon {
  width: 56rpx;
  height: 56rpx;
  border: 3rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  font-size: 38rpx;
  line-height: 52rpx;
  text-align: center;
}

.album-icon {
  font-size: 30rpx;
}

.control-label {
  margin-top: 10rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.shutter-outer {
  width: 146rpx;
  height: 146rpx;
  margin: 0 auto;
  border: 7rpx solid #ffffff;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.shutter-inner {
  width: 112rpx;
  height: 112rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #ffffff;
}

.shutter-active {
  transform: scale(0.92);
  opacity: 0.68;
}

.shutter-disabled {
  opacity: 0.4;
}

.confirm-view {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: #f5f6f8;
}

.captured-preview {
  width: 100%;
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 0;
  background: #111111;
}

.confirm-caption {
  height: 92rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: #ffffff;
  color: #273047;
  font-size: 27rpx;
}

.confirm-actions {
  display: flex;
  padding: 18rpx 24rpx 18rpx;
  border-top: 2rpx solid #edf0f5;
  background: #ffffff;
}

.confirm-button {
  height: 88rpx;
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 27rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.retake-button {
  border: 2rpx solid #2f7df6;
  color: #2f7df6;
}

.use-button {
  background: #2f7df6;
  color: #ffffff;
}

.camera-error-view {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  padding: 80rpx 56rpx 56rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: #15171b;
  color: #ffffff;
}

.error-symbol {
  width: 84rpx;
  height: 84rpx;
  margin-bottom: 28rpx;
  border: 4rpx solid #f6b51b;
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: #f6b51b;
  font-size: 48rpx;
  line-height: 80rpx;
  text-align: center;
}

.error-title {
  font-size: 34rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.error-text {
  margin: 18rpx 0 42rpx;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 1.6;
  text-align: center;
}

.error-button {
  width: 100%;
  height: 88rpx;
  margin-top: 18rpx;
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 27rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.primary-error-button {
  background: #2f7df6;
}

.secondary-error-button {
  border: 2rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
  color: #ffffff;
}


/* Alipay layout compatibility: WX grid/gap fallback */
.confirm-actions {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.confirm-btn {
  width: 48.5%;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
